  "html": "<article id=\"post-5559\" class=\"container post-5559 page type-page status-publish has-post-thumbnail hentry\">\n\n\t<div class=\"entry-content | container\">\n\t\t<section  class=\"container section--services-hero pt-5 services-hero\">\n\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main\">\n\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row__left\">\n                <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group full-width-mobile is-vertical is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-2c90304e wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group flow center-content-mobile full-width-mobile has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group h-align icon-plus-title is-layout-flex wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">    <div class=\"iconblock wp-elements-1 has-background has-red-background-color has-text-color has-secondary-inverse-color\" data-size=\"md\" data-padding=\"2\" data-display=\"inline\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-info\" /></svg>    </div>\n\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading has-primary-inverse-color has-text-color has-link-color has-x-large-font-size wp-elements-2\">HVAC, Plumbing &amp; Indoor Air Quality Services in Hillsborough, NC </h1>\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Happy Home Services provides heating and cooling, plumbing, and indoor air quality service across Hillsborough, with pricing set before work starts and calls answered 24/7. The town&#8217;s oldest homes date to the eighteenth and nineteenth&nbsp;centuries, and&nbsp;fitting modern comfort into them without damaging what makes them valuable is a specialty of ours.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Retrofitting a centuries-old house is a different discipline from servicing a subdivision build. Plaster walls rule out casual duct&nbsp;runs,&nbsp;original framing deserves protection, and pipe replaced in stages over a hundred years fails in unpredictable places. Hillsborough also keeps a rural side, with well-dependent properties minutes from downtown, and we service that side too.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group mb-1 full-width-mobile is-content-justification-left is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-a1b15d37 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div  class=\"wp-block-group mb-3 full-width-mobile schedule-and-call-cta is-content-justification-left is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-a1b15d37 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group schedule-cta-container is-vertical is-content-justification-stretch is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-41171c72 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<a href=\"/bookings\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"solid\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-level=\"primary\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta se-widget-button\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-event\" /></svg><span >Schedule Now</span>\n\n</a>\n\n    <p class=\"horizon-text has-secondary-font-family wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase\">or speak with an expert!</p>\n\n<a href=\"tel:+13362819025\" aria-label=\"Call now: +13362819025\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"solid\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-level=\"primary\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta phone-link\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-phone\" /></svg><span data-show-on=\"desktop\">(336) 281-9025</span>\n        <span data-show-on=\"mobile\">Call Now</span>\n</a>\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color has-secondary-font-family has-small-font-size text-center wp-elements-3 wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase\"><strong>Same Day Appointments Available by Phone</strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div  class=\"badge mb-3\" style='min-height:unset;'>\n    <div class=\"badge__content\">\n        <svg width=\"45\" height=\"45\" viewBox=\"0 0 45 45\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n            <title>Google</title>\n            <path d=\"M42.0046 22.9145C42.0046 21.4661 41.8746 20.0733 41.6332 18.7363H22.395V26.647H33.3882C32.9054 29.191 31.457 31.3451 29.2844 32.7935V37.9373H35.9137C39.7762 34.372 42.0046 29.1353 42.0046 22.9145Z\" fill=\"#4285F4\"/>\n            <path d=\"M22.396 42.8766C27.9112 42.8766 32.535 41.0568 35.9147 37.9371L29.2854 32.7933C27.4655 34.0189 25.1443 34.7617 22.396 34.7617C17.0851 34.7617 12.5727 31.1777 10.9571 26.3496H4.16064V31.6234C7.52175 38.2899 14.4111 42.8766 22.396 42.8766Z\" fill=\"#34A853\"/>\n            <path d=\"M10.9608 26.3308C10.5523 25.1052 10.3109 23.8053 10.3109 22.4498C10.3109 21.0942 10.5523 19.7943 10.9608 18.5687V13.2949H4.16436C2.77164 16.0432 1.97314 19.1444 1.97314 22.4498C1.97314 25.7551 2.77164 28.8563 4.16436 31.6046L9.45671 27.4821L10.9608 26.3308Z\" fill=\"#FBBC05\"/>\n            <path d=\"M22.396 10.155C25.4043 10.155 28.0783 11.1949 30.2138 13.2004L36.0633 7.35097C32.5165 4.04557 27.9112 2.02148 22.396 2.02148C14.4111 2.02148 7.52175 6.60818 4.16064 13.2933L10.9571 18.567C12.5727 13.7389 17.0851 10.155 22.396 10.155Z\" fill=\"#EA4335\"/>\n        </svg>\n        <div class=\"badge__content__rating-container\">\n            <p class=\"h6 badge__content__rating-container__title\">Google Rating</p>\n            <div class=\"badge__content__rating-container__stars\">\n                <div class=\"badge__content__rating-container__stars__number\">\n                    5                </div>\n                <div class=\"badge__content__rating-container__stars__container\">\n                    <div class=\"badge__content__rating-container__stars__container__black\">★★★★★</div>\n                    <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"badge__content__rating-container__stars__container__white\">☆☆☆☆☆</div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n    </div></div>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\t\t\t</div><!-- ./left -->\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row__right\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elevated content-fullbleed-mobile box-shadow-lg border-radius-lg\" >\n    <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">\n\t\t\t<figure class=\"wp-block-post-featured-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" src=\"/images/2024/10/NU-HappyHome_Group-Shot-10-scaled.jpg\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"Happy Home team dedicated to providing top quality HVAC, Plumbing, and Indoor Air Quality all across Raleigh-Durham\" style=\"object-fit:cover;\" srcset=\"/images/2024/10/NU-HappyHome_Group-Shot-10-scaled.jpg 2560w, /images/2024/10/NU-HappyHome_Group-Shot-10-300x200.jpg 300w, /images/2024/10/NU-HappyHome_Group-Shot-10-1024x683.jpg 1024w, /images/2024/10/NU-HappyHome_Group-Shot-10-768x512.jpg 768w, /images/2024/10/NU-HappyHome_Group-Shot-10-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, /images/2024/10/NU-HappyHome_Group-Shot-10-2048x1365.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1010px) 100vw, (max-width: 1440px) 50vw, 768px\" /></figure>\n\t\t\t</div>\n</div>\t\t\t</div><!-- ./right -->\n\t\t</div><!-- ./row -->\n\n</div>\n\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main section--services-hero__main--empty has-background has-secondary-background-color\">\n\t</div><!-- ./row -->\n\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group container flow pb-4 has-secondary-inverse-color has-primary-background-color has-text-color has-background\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60)\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group wrap-mobile flow pb-4 has-primary-inverse-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-4 is-horizontal is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-cdbf0242 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:0;padding-bottom:0\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-db3ccc14 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:0;padding-bottom:0\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column flow is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h5 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Heating and Cooling for Historic and Modern Homes </h5>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Gas reaches&nbsp;most of&nbsp;town, and Hillsborough runs the full Piedmont equipment mix of furnaces, heat pumps, and hybrids. Humid summers and freeze-prone winters keep both halves of every system working.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"/services/cooling/air-conditioning\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Air Conditioning Services in Hillsborough</strong></a>&nbsp;Installation, replacement, repair, and seasonal tune-ups on every major brand, with honest guidance when an old unit reaches the repair-or-replace line.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"/services/heating/gas-furnaces\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Gas Furnace Services in Hillsborough</strong></a>&nbsp;Furnaces carry the established&nbsp;neighborhoods&nbsp;and heat pumps the newer ones, and we&nbsp;maintain&nbsp;both on&nbsp;schedules that catch faults before deep winter finds them.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"/services/cooling/mini-split\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Ductless Mini-Split Systems</strong></a>&nbsp;For homes built one or two centuries before ductwork, mini-splits deliver room-by-room heating and cooling with no original plaster&nbsp;opened. They are the single most valuable tool we have for Hillsborough&#8217;s historic district.&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h5 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Indoor Air Quality in Old Houses </h5>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Long pollen seasons and humid summers press on every Hillsborough home, and the town&#8217;s oldest houses, with their vented crawl spaces and retrofit ductwork, feel it most indoors.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"/services/dehumidifiers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Whole-Home and Crawlspace Dehumidifiers</strong></a>: Moisture control protects irreplaceable old framing and finishes and keeps crawl space air from turning musty.&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"/services/indoor-air-quality/air-ducts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Air Duct Cleaning and Sealing</strong></a>: Retrofit duct runs in older homes leak more than most. Sealing and cleaning&nbsp;recovers&nbsp;efficiency and air quality together.&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"/services/indoor-air-quality/air-purifiers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Air Filtration and Purification</strong></a>: High-efficiency filtration reduces the pollen and dust load indoors when the season peaks.&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column flow is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h5 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Plumbing for Old Walls and Rural Wells </h5>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In-town Hillsborough draws treated water from the Eno River and local reservoirs, arriving&nbsp;relatively soft, so softening rarely pays here. The real work divides between careful pipe replacement inside historic homes and full well service for the properties outside the municipal system.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"/services/plumbing/repiping-services\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Repiping and Pipe Repair</strong></a>&nbsp;In a historic home,&nbsp;repiping&nbsp;is planned around the structure, routing new lines to protect original materials while&nbsp;retiring&nbsp;the corroded galvanized and cast iron behind the walls. Done during a renovation, it settles pressure and discoloration problems permanently.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"/services/plumbing/well-pump\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Well Pump Services</strong></a>&nbsp;Rural Orange County properties get pump and pressure tank repair and replacement, with&nbsp;<a href=\"/services/plumbing/water-treatment-filtration\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">water treatment</a>&nbsp;for hard, iron-heavy, or odorous supplies.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"/services/plumbing/water-heater-installation-replacements\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Water Heater Installation and Replacement</strong></a>&nbsp;Tank and tankless units sized to the household, with placement planned around older homes&#8217; tight mechanical spaces.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"/services/plumbing/sump-pumps\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Sump Pump Services</strong></a>&nbsp;Low-lying crawl spaces near the Eno collect water in heavy rain, and&nbsp;a properly installed&nbsp;sump pump keeps it from standing under the house.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"/services/plumbing/frozen-burst-pipe-repair\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Frozen and Burst Pipe Repair</strong></a>&nbsp;Old under-insulated lines fail first in a freeze. We stop the water fast and repair the break, and&nbsp;everyday&nbsp;<a href=\"/services/plumbing/kitchen-bathroom\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">kitchen and bathroom plumbing</a>&nbsp;is always on the truck.&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Careful Work for Homes Worth the Care </h4>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A historic house rewards patience and punishes shortcuts, and our trained technicians plan every retrofit around the structure rather than through it. Pricing is presented in writing before work begins, backed by honest, upfront pricing and a 100% money-back guarantee. Call or book online to schedule service anywhere in Hillsborough. </p>\n</div>\n\n<div  class=\"accordion\" style=\"--_accordion-separator-color: #076395\">\n            <details class=\"accordion-item\" data-custom-open=\"true\" open>\n            <summary class=\"accordion-title | paired-icon-text\">\n                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--closed | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevrondown\" /></svg>                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--open | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronup\" /></svg>                <p class=\"paired-text\">Do you work on Hillsborough&#8217;s historic homes? </p>\n            </summary>\n\n            <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n                <div class=\"accordion-content-inner\">\n                    <p>Yes, regularly. Mini-splits add heating and cooling without disturbing original walls, and our repiping work is routed to protect historic materials while retiring failed pipe.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </details>            <details class=\"accordion-item\">\n            <summary class=\"accordion-title | paired-icon-text\">\n                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--closed | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevrondown\" /></svg>                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--open | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronup\" /></svg>                <p class=\"paired-text\">Does Happy Home answer emergency calls in Hillsborough on holidays? </p>\n            </summary>\n\n            <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n                <div class=\"accordion-content-inner\">\n                    <p>Yes. Coverage runs 24/7 across Hillsborough and Orange County, holidays included.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </details>            <details class=\"accordion-item\">\n            <summary class=\"accordion-title | paired-icon-text\">\n                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--closed | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevrondown\" /></svg>                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--open | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronup\" /></svg>                <p class=\"paired-text\">I live on a well a few minutes outside town. Is that in your range? </p>\n            </summary>\n\n            <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n                <div class=\"accordion-content-inner\">\n                    <p>Absolutely. Well pump and pressure tank service plus treatment for hard, iron-heavy, or odorous water are standard calls for our rural Orange County routes.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </details>            <details class=\"accordion-item\">\n            <summary class=\"accordion-title | paired-icon-text\">\n                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--closed | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevrondown\" /></svg>                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--open | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronup\" /></svg>                <p class=\"paired-text\">Is Hillsborough&#8217;s town water hard or soft? </p>\n            </summary>\n\n            <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n                <div class=\"accordion-content-inner\">\n                    <p>Soft, relatively speaking. The Eno-sourced municipal supply arrives treated and soft enough that softeners rarely pay for themselves in town, while private wells outside the system are a case-by-case question a water test answers.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </details>            <details class=\"accordion-item\">\n            <summary class=\"accordion-title | paired-icon-text\">\n                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--closed | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevrondown\" /></svg>                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--open | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronup\" /></svg>                <p class=\"paired-text\">What nearby towns fall within your Hillsborough service area? </p>\n            </summary>\n\n            <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n                <div class=\"accordion-content-inner\">\n                    <p>Efland, Cedar Grove, and Schley are all covered, along with the wider Triangle. The Service Areas menu lists everything.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </details>    </div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group container flow py-5\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Powered by NearU — We’re here to make your HVAC Service experience the best one yet!</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"430\" height=\"98\" src=\"/images/2024/02/NearU.png\" alt=\"NearU\" class=\"wp-image-36\" style=\"width:220px\" srcset=\"/images/2024/02/NearU.png 430w, /images/2024/02/NearU-300x68.png 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 430px) 100vw, 430px\" /></figure>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">NearU is setting up a new standard of HVAC, plumbing, drains, IAQ, and generator services with major improvements to reliability, convenience, and customer care. We equip our companies with better resources, training, and tools, so they can provide you with the best possible service outcome. If you’ve recently learned that your go-to HVAC, plumbing, drains, IAQ, and generator company has joined NearU, then this is something to get excited about! We protect the people and culture that make each company great, while ensuring their customers consistently receive the best possible care.</p>\n</div>\n\t</div>\n\t</article><!-- #post-5559 -->"
}